                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/releases/tag/v1.85.3"&gt;Release v1.85.3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;This is release gRPC Core 1.85.3 (googol).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For gRPC documentation, see &lt;a href="https://grpc.io/" rel="nofollow"&gt;grpc.io&lt;/a&gt;. For previous releases, see &lt;a href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/releases"&gt;Releases&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Python-only release that contains a bug fix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Python&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6437417933" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/43961" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/grpc/grpc/pull/43961/hovercard" href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/43961"&gt;#43961&lt;/a&gt; Fixed a deadlock that could freeze the entire Python process when closing a channel (synchronous API) while gRPC's background threads were running Python callbacks (for example, call credentials plugins). (Backport of &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4339726712" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/42247" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/grpc/grpc/pull/42247/hovercard" href="https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/42247"&gt;#42247&lt;/a&gt;; credits: &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/PeterZhizhin/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/PeterZhizhin"&gt;@PeterZhizhin&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
